WEBVTT

00:33:30.120 --> 00:33:32.136
CA: Let's go briefly
on the other two areas

00:33:32.160 --> 00:33:35.128
where you think
that China really has an edge.

00:33:35.152 --> 00:33:39.117
One obvious one, I guess,
is the data, just the scale of China.

00:33:39.141 --> 00:33:43.395
And the fact that there's this huge lead
on cashless payments,

00:33:43.419 --> 00:33:45.744
gives this vast treasure trove of data

00:33:45.768 --> 00:33:50.014
that is an accelerant
to building so many companies.

00:33:50.038 --> 00:33:52.260
The third one is the support
by the government,

00:33:52.284 --> 00:33:54.722
the fact that the government
has specifically said,

00:33:54.746 --> 00:33:58.204
we get it, we see that AI
is going to determine

00:33:58.228 --> 00:33:59.426
so much in the future,

00:33:59.450 --> 00:34:02.521
we want to have leadership in that area.